                "section": "3.1",
                "snippet": "New hires have 30 calendar days from their hire date to enrol in benefits through the HR Portal."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          },
          {
            "text": "If you enrol within your window, coverage is back-dated to the first day of the month after your hire date. Until you enrol, you have no Ridgeline coverage.",
