                "doc_id": "RSE-BEN-01",
                "section": "1.2",
                "snippet": "Until you enrol, you have no Ridgeline coverage, so enrol early in your window."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          },
          {
            "text": "HR cannot extend the new-hire window. If you miss it, you can next enrol at open enrollment unless you have a qualifying life event. This could leave you without Ridgeline coverage until the next plan year.",
            "citations": [
              {
                "doc_id": "RSE-BEN-01",
                "section": "3.2",
                "snippet": "HR cannot extend the new-hire window, so missing it can leave you without Ridgeline coverage until the next plan year."
              }
            ],
            "data_sources": []
          },
          {
