                  "section_heading": "If you miss the window",
                  "text": "If you miss your new-hire window, you can next enrol at open enrollment, unless you have a qualifying life event (\u00a73.4) before then.\nHR cannot extend the new-hire window, so missing it can leave you without Ridgeline coverage until the next plan year. If you are close to the end of your window and unsure what to choose, enrol in a plan now; you can change your choices at open enrollment.",
                  "score": 0.0323
